  "basis": "fresh",
  "qa": "spike recoveries Zn 90.49-109.93%, Cd 91.96-115.13%, Pb 91.80-111.13% (85.71-111.13% in the Thai conclusion), Cu 89.43-100.38%; HORRAT below 2; no CRM",
